<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Remove operator status from a user in the current channel. This is a shorthand for"
  )} <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/mode -o nickname")}</code>.
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_question}>{dgettext("help_commands", "When to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Remove operator status when someone no longer helps run the channel. You can also use it on your own nickname to step down."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/deop <nickname>")}</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>nickname</code> {dgettext("help_commands", "— The user to demote from operator.")}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "The command acts on the channel you are viewing. The user becomes a regular member. Any voice they had before is not restored, so in a moderated (+m) channel they cannot speak until they get voice again. Everyone in the channel sees a mode change line, and the user moves to the Users group in the nick list."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "If the channel is registered and the user is on its ChanServ access list, they get the status from that list back the next time they join."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Requires operator (@) or owner (~) status in the channel")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "The target must be in the channel")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Half-operators cannot remove operator status")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Only the first nickname is used. Extra words are ignored.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "You must type it in a channel window, not in a private conversation"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/deop Alice")}</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-op">{dgettext("help_commands", "/op")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="ui-context-menu">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Context Menu")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-devoice">{dgettext("help_commands", "/devoice")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-mode">{dgettext("help_commands", "/mode")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="mode-o">{dgettext("help_commands", "+o Operator")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="chanserv-access">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "ChanServ Access Lists")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="channel-permissions">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Channel Permissions")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
